            RowBox[{"raw", ",", "bg"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"dE", "=", 
        RowBox[{"Together", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"RawExpr", "[", 
           RowBox[{"HeldEthRedField", "[", 
            RowBox[{"g", ",", "bg"}], "]"}], "]"}], "-", 
          RowBox[{"RawFieldExpr", "[", 
           RowBox[{"HeldEthRawField", "[", 
            RowBox[{"raw", ",", "bg"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"dEb", "=", 
        RowBox[{"Together", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"RawExpr", "[", 
           RowBox[{"HeldEthBarRedField", "[", 
            RowBox[{"g", ",", "bg"}], "]"}], "]"}], "-", 
          RowBox[{"RawFieldExpr", "[", 
           RowBox[{"HeldEthBarRawField", "[", 
            RowBox[{"raw", ",", "bg"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"pts", "=", 
        RowBox[{"SamplePointsRZ", "[", 
         RowBox[{"2.5", ",", "12.0", ",", "6", ",", 
          RowBox[{"-", "0.95"}], ",", "0.95", ",", "7"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"vP", "=", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"NumericValueAt", "[", 
           RowBox[{"dP", ",", 
            RowBox[{"#", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"#", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", "pts"}]}], 
       ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"vPp", "=", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"NumericValueAt", "[", 
           RowBox[{"dPp", ",", 
            RowBox[{"#", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"#", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", "pts"}]}], 
       ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"vE", "=", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"NumericValueAt", "[", 
           RowBox[{"dE", ",", 
            RowBox[{"#", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"#", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", "pts"}]}], 
       ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"vEb", "=", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"NumericValueAt", "[", 
           RowBox[{"dEb", ",", 
            RowBox[{"#", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"#", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", "pts"}]}], 
       ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<Points\>\"", "->", "pts"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<thornDiffExpr\>\"", "->", "dP"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<thornPrimeDiffExpr\>\"", "->", "dPp"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<ethDiffExpr\>\"", "->", "dE"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<ethbarDiffExpr\>\"", "->", "dEb"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<thornValues\>\"", "->", "vP"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<thornPrimeValues\>\"", "->", "vPp"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<ethValues\>\"", "->", "vE"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<ethbarValues\>\"", "->", "vEb"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<thornMaxAbs\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "vP", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<thornPrimeMaxAbs\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "vPp", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<ethMaxAbs\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "vE", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<ethbarMaxAbs\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "vEb", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "|>"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
   ";"}], "\n"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"OperatorConsistencyTests", "[", 
